    {
      "id": "claim_a6d91e1cdd454a7b83894cd11d6640bd",
      "statement": "publish_review resolves the effective head SHA from thread metadata (a mid-run push updates the live head there ahead of the run's frozen config), then records the GitHub review id and per-comment/thread ids back onto each finding to avoid a surfaced-but-unrecorded state.",
