      "statement": "process_github_push_event re-triggers the reviewer only for a watched reviewer thread whose PR head actually changed; it short-circuits when the head equals last_reviewed_sha, the thread is not watching, or the diff is proven unchanged, in which case it advances last_reviewed_sha and creates-then-settles a 'No new changes to review' check on the new head so the check stays visible.",
